From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiago Vignatti <vignatti@google.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:05:59 -0300
Subject: [M150-LTS] FSA: Add missing sensitive paths to the blocklist

M150-LTS conflicts:
  - c/b/f/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc:
    Resolved adjacent context conflicts in GenerateBlockPaths() around
    .git/hooks (d29950974965c) and base::DIR_CACHE (f57f211284300),
    which are not in M150.
  - c/b/f/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context_unittest.cc:
    Adapted ConfirmSensitiveEntryAccess_GitConfigAndModulesWriteBlock to
    use M150's UserAction enum instead of AccessTrigger (5c2b1b197d268)
    and omitted the case-variation check requiring e1de15af9a3b0.

Original change's description:
> FSA: Add missing sensitive paths to the blocklist
>
> Several sensitive locations are still reachable through File System
> Access because they are missing from the sensitive-path blocklist, or
> are only blocked on some platforms. Add them:
>
> - Block write access to */.git/config and */.git/modules on all
>   platforms, alongside */.git/hooks. Reads stay allowed, so web Git
>   clients can still read repository configuration.
> - Block ~/.config on all platforms. It was only blocked on Linux,
>   ChromeOS and Android.
> - Block shell startup files in the home directory on all platforms,
>   including the ones Git Bash reads on Windows.
> - Block /dev on macOS, matching Linux.
> - Block ~/.local/share, the legacy fontconfig files ~/.fonts.conf and
>   ~/.fonts.conf.d, and the NSS database directory ~/.pki on Linux and
>   ChromeOS.
>
> Bug: 572269631, 571913154, 569012015, 558362029
> Bug: 569012543, 561996724, 559780982, 557367241
> Test: unit_tests --gtest_filter=ChromeFileSystemAccessPermissionContextTest.*ConfirmSensitiveEntryAccess*
> Change-Id: Ia6fe9e51807e8106fbc6ac69e28d550660e49b38
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8619619
> Reviewed-by: Fergal Daly <fergal@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Mingyu Lei <leimy@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1724465}

(cherry picked from commit d6f2c70dbb4cd97f6eaf62aed88c8f2e57ef3fce)

Bug: 572269631, 571913154, 569012015, 558362029
