Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
- Electron's refactor_expose_file_system_access_blocklist.patch moves the
  kBlockedPaths table out of chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc
  into chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.h, so the .cc hunks of
  this CL have no target here. The exact same blocklist additions (and the
  removal of the Linux-only ~/.config entry) are applied to the table in the
  header instead. The unittest hunks apply unchanged.

